---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { pages } from '../lib/registry';
---

<Page
  {...pages['/contact/']}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Start', href: '/' },
    { label: 'Contact', href: '/contact/' },
  ]}
>
  <header class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">International remote enquiries welcome</p>
    <h1>What could work better?</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Tell me about one repetitive task, a focused implementation or a team that
      needs help adopting a tool. Hiring enquiries are welcome too.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="reading">
    <h2>Start with a short email.</h2>
    <p>
      A useful first message describes what your business does, the workflow you
      want to improve and where it gets stuck. You do not need to send
      confidential documents or account credentials.
    </p>
    <div class="contact-options">
      <a
        class="button"
        href="mailto:moldach686@gmail.com?subject=Consulting%20enquiry"
      >
        Email Matthew ↗
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/services/">
        Compare engagements
      </a>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:moldach686@gmail.com">moldach686@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
    <h2>What happens next?</h2>
    <p>
      We establish whether the work is a fit, what access or examples would be
      needed, and which engagement makes sense. Scope and commercial terms are
      agreed before paid work begins.
    </p>
    <p>
      Enquiries go directly to the published email address. A website form will
      be added only after its receiving account and delivery are configured and
      tested.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/privacy/">Read how contact information is handled.</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Page>
